  "question": "An electric dipole of moment $p$ is placed in a uniform electric field $E$ with its axis at $30°$ to the field. The torque on it is",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}pE$",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "zero",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\dfrac{pE}{2}$",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$pE$",
      "image": ""
    }
  ],
  "answer": "C",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$\\tau = pE\\sin 30° = \\dfrac{pE}{2}$. (The net force is zero in a uniform field.)",
